---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-76-cross-case-learning-portfolio-policy-retirement-registry.json";

const learning = registry.institutional_learning_dossiers;
const comparisons = registry.cross_case_transfer_registers;
const portfolios = registry.portfolio_governance_registers;
const policies = registry.policy_supersession_retirement_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Cross-Case Learning And Portfolio Governance | FTFN" description="Eight inactive institutional-learning dossiers, twenty-eight pairwise transfer reviews, six portfolio-governance registers, and eight policy-retirement ledgers.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-learning-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Institutional Learning</div><h1 class="page-title">One audited decision is not a universal lesson. Supersession is not erasure.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 76 separates learning admission, pairwise comparability, transfer conditions, institutional memory, shared dependencies, cumulative burden, portfolio governance, policy supersession, retirement, decommissioning, residual duties, and permanent archive.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive learning dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="28 inactive pairwise reviews" /><MetaPill label="6 inactive portfolios" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive retirement ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 conclusions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Institutional Memory</div><h2>Eight audited-decision admission records remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/institutional-memory-negative-results-001/">Read the memory protocol</a></div><div class="grid">{learning.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.learning_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label={record.cohort_id} /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/learning/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Fourteen admission gates retain decision, implementation, benefit, harm, distribution, context, failure, dissent, correction, and archive lineage.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Pairwise Transfer</div><h2>All twenty-eight possible case pairs remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/atlas/dependency-maps/audited-decision-is-not-transferable-policy/">Inspect the transfer boundary</a></div><div class="source-list">{comparisons.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/learning/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.cross_case_transfer_register_id}: {record.left_named_entity} / {record.right_named_entity}</a></h3><p>Sixteen gates and twelve transfer-condition classes; no comparable pair, lesson, exception, or reuse decision.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.transfer_decision} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Portfolio Governance</div><h2>Six thematic portfolios expose shared-risk questions without ranking cases.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/atlas/dependency-maps/portfolio-benefit-is-not-shared-benefit/">Inspect the portfolio boundary</a></div><div class="grid">{portfolios.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.portfolio_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label={`${record.named_entities.length} members`} /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/learning/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.portfolio_label}</a></h3><p>Shared dependencies, concentration, sequencing, cumulative burden, distribution, safeguards, rebalancing, and exit remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Policy Lifecycle</div><h2>Eight supersession, retirement, and decommissioning ledgers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/policy-retirement-decommissioning-001/">Read the retirement method</a></div><div class="grid">{policies.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/learning/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.policy_supersession_retirement_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Fourteen lifecycle gates and ten decommissioning obligations preserve transition, residual duties, remedy, and archive.</p><MetaPill label={record.lifecycle_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty comparison and institutional-memory state.</h2><p>The export publishes admission, comparability, transfer, portfolio, retirement, decommissioning, and archive controls. It contains no audited decision, learning memo, transfer finding, portfolio conclusion, supersession, retirement, receipt, score, rank, or stage change.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/cross-case-learning-portfolio-policy-retirement.json">Learning and portfolio JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
